### Frontend URL: https://orange-plant-0ccfa0d00.1.azurestaticapps.net

### 1. Test app is running
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts/health

### 2. Test sample image accessibility
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/uploads/samples/pets/cat-01.jpg

### 3. Create site admin account (do this first)
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "siteadmin",
  "email": "admin@yourcompany.com",
  "password": "YourStrongPassword123!",
  "firstName": "Site",
  "lastName": "Admin"
}

### 4. Login as site admin (after updating role to site_admin)
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin@yourcompany.com",
  "password": "YourStrongPassword123!"
}

### 5. Check database status
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/database-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Seed mock data (first time)
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/seed-mock-data?forceRecreate=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get mock data summary
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/mock-data-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Test paginated posts
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&pageSize=10

### 9. Test with mock user login
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "member01@petwhenua.co.nz",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### 10. Re-seed data (force recreate)
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/seed-mock-data?forceRecreate=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Clear all mock data (if needed)
DELETE {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/admin/clear-mock-data
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Test different page sizes
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&pageSize=20

### 13. Test filtered posts
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/posts?postType=moment&page=1&pageSize=10

### 14. Test users endpoint
GET {{azureBaseUrl}}/api/users 